<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκκ-ίζομαι</span></b> , Dep. (
			Act.
		 only <i><span class="en">
			Ael.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			9
		</span></i>), fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκκιοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					309
				</span></i>
			:—<i>affect indifference</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				203
			</span></i> (cj.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>affect ignorance, dissemble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶσθα, ἀλλ᾽ ἀκκίζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					497a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				2.19.5
			</span></i>, Luc <i><span class="en">
				<u>Merc. Cond.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.223b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κοινὰ ταυτὶ ἀκκιοῦμαι</span>
			<i>I will dissemble</i> and talk commonplaces, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> esp. of
			women, <i>to be prudish, affect to be shocked</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philippid.
				5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
